{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_title", "source_sha256": "27733158024648b5e60fd2f783370a532be57b8489db68199567b6ed7f2cf0a0", "ja": "千早とおでかけ1", "zh": "和千早外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6271605e39b973b23eb3f884f41e15eea4189e92510d4ef94129acb3c6cd242f", "ja": "千早とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和千早外出一游的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b6e3de8d09dbdcca52edee6c9912f0af03680ed85582b5025f6345726b984a3", "ja": "（千早が兼六園でのライブイベントにゲスト出演\nする事になった。和を感じる、素敵な場所だな……）", "zh": "（千早要作为嘉宾参加兼六园的现场活动。真是个充满和风气息的美丽地方啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5b68f9ab30c67ffbc1f988874e44fbbca785a0da90f88db52b666de580ae2044", "ja": "千早、そろそろ出番だけど、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "千早，差不多该你上场了，状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "29611d459b2da46a401e7636ea7203f34d4371e65d65e9435a7acdcce7185475", "ja": "ええ、悪くありません。今日はよく晴れているので、\n清々しい気持ちで歌えそうです。", "zh": "嗯，不算差。今天阳光明媚，感觉可以怀着清爽的心情歌唱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f5cd136ff75cad3dc19c106c72242bd1088adc6c65c44c50a68b02ca6635a1d5", "ja": "それはよかった。それにしても、すごい庭園だな。\nなんだか神聖な感じすらするというか……。", "zh": "那就好。不过话说回来，这庭园还真气派啊。甚至让人觉得有种神圣的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "7702b233a04a822940ba6ffcc89e575e97d63c2752d095e0d07a047e15a8f841", "ja": "同感です。この素晴らしい庭園に、相応しい歌を\n歌わなければと思うと……責任重大ですね。", "zh": "我也这么觉得。一想到必须唱出配得上\n这座绝美庭园的歌曲……就觉得责任重大呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e5bb6011a793fb03131ec5033aa47582802a07f7580177ea9658dc5fd6dca315", "ja": "そんなに気負わなくても、千早の実力なら\n普段通りやれば大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "不用这么紧张，以千早的实力，照平时发挥就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "67237401cf2644a256be32acd9bf265830fbdd090641d8d9fad01ab83f26e76b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。でも、今日は私も、\n少し考えていることがあって……。", "zh": "谢谢您。不过，今天我自己\n也有点在考虑的事情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "ae4080a3505023eb276409765e973d5d95c932246a02ce7f931d8d48ebebdcb5", "ja": "{$P$}。あの、\n相談したいことがあるんですけど……いいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。那个，我有件事想和您商量……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "43a5be1a1d019c7e276e675b4759870ecddd3c822393d802e56423f56d5390d6", "ja": "ああ、構わないけど……？", "zh": "啊，没问题，不过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "d5f2298e9f8d74f48393feec493ff89e671d97f95c267e65bcf062102d6c6352", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n……どうですか？　うまくいきましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n……怎么样？进展顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d3eee6c0fd58e6be15f876b3dfa152da486a93a006eef1e0dee94f416f7a5d20", "ja": "お疲れ様、千早！　ああ、バッチリだ。\nすごく『和』を感じたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，千早！啊，棒极了。\n感觉特别有“和”的韵味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "ff9afa7c7da7ac20814c19f4f15a33e96a276a3d653b28b4cc1e28fbf45de86c", "ja": "よかった……。日本庭園だったので、\n和楽器の音は、雰囲気に合うかと思って。", "zh": "太好了……因为是日本庭园，\n我想和乐器的声音应该很符合氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "adecc2e18241d23eea2b7f15e1fb98f69d648b00fa9085b3132b1b94ebd097e5", "ja": "思いつきでしたけど、うまくいって良かったです。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "虽然只是灵机一动，但能顺利进行真是太好了。\n{$P$}，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4311296b46f6c6b63c838cebfad3d6b7beedd126e7aab46adffa90f3a291bf2", "ja": "（見せ方を自分から提案し、臨機応変に対応する……\n千早の成長には、目を見張るものがあるな！）", "zh": "（主动提出表现方式，还能随机应变……\n千早的成长真是令人刮目相看啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
